  "pages": [
    {
      "page_idx": 28,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.057,
            0.188,
            0.071
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "158"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.43,
            0.055,
            0.597,
            0.072
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "细胞生物学实验教程"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.09,
            0.906,
            0.11
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "0.5%十二烷基肌氨酸钠（sarkosyl），各组分混合，65℃搅拌溶解，室温可保存3个月。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.112,
            0.367,
            0.131
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2）RNA 抽提缓冲液:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.303,
            0.133,
            0.608,
            0.153
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "硫氰酸胍变性液 20ml"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.302,
            0.155,
            0.636,
            0.175
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "β-巯基乙醇 0.144ml"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.304,
            0.176,
            0.6,
            0.195
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2mol/L NaAc (pH4.0) 2ml"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.303,
            0.197,
            0.608,
            0.216
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "水饱和酚 22ml"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.218,
            0.505,
            0.238
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "混合后，避光，于 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 可保存2个月。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.248,
            0.299,
            0.271
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【方法与步骤】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.282,
            0.877,
            0.302
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 材料的制备: 豚鼠或大白鼠击头处死, 迅速取出肝脏, 置于冰浴的器皿中。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.124,
            0.304,
            0.909,
            0.344
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 裂解及匀浆:适量的材料（0.1～0.3g）加入 2.0ml 的抽提缓冲液，冰浴条件下匀浆。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.347,
            0.753,
            0.366
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 每 2.0ml 的匀浆液加入  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "200\\mu l"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  氯仿，混合均匀，冰浴 15min。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.368,
            0.522,
            0.387
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(4) 裂解物在  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " C，5000g 离心 30min。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.389,
            0.83,
            0.408
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(5) 收集水相, 转移到新管中, 加入 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 异丙醇, 于 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "-20^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 放置 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 \\mathrm{~h}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 以上。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.411,
            0.521,
            0.429
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(6) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ", 8000g 离心 30min 收集沉淀。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.124,
            0.432,
            0.911,
            0.472
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(7) 沉淀用 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "70\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 乙醇洗涤几次, 干燥使乙醇挥发, 注意不要过于干燥, 否则难以溶解。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.474,
            0.761,
            0.494
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(8) 沉淀溶于无 RNA 酶的水中, 测光密度 (OD) 值, 计算得率。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.502,
            0.275,
            0.525
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【注意事项】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.533,
            0.909,
            0.574
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) RNA 易降解, 实验中应避免 RNA 酶的污染。操作中要戴手套, 不要交谈, 因为唾液及皮肤都含有 RNA 酶。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.576,
            0.753,
            0.596
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 尽量使用一次性用具，器皿以及试剂应做 RNA 酶灭活处理。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.171,
            0.598,
            0.39,
            0.616
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "- 附 RNA 酶灭活方法"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.167,
            0.619,
            0.514,
            0.637
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1）玻璃制品:180℃高温干烤数小时。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.64,
            0.912,
            0.703
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2）塑料制品:浸泡于 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0.1\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的DEPC（焦碳酸乙酯）水溶液中，室温下放置数小时后，再用水淋洗，烘干并高压蒸汽灭菌 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "15\\mathrm{min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " （目的是为了除去残留的痕量DEPC，以防止DEPC通过羧甲基化作用对RNA的嘌呤碱基进行修饰）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 24,
          "bbox": [
            0.126,
            0.705,
            0.913,
            0.745
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3）RNA 专用电泳槽:电泳槽洗涤干净，用乙醇干燥，再灌满 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "3\\% \\mathrm{H}_2\\mathrm{O}_2"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 溶液，室温放置 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10\\mathrm{min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "，然后用 DEPC 处理过的水冲洗电泳槽。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 25,
          "bbox": [
            0.126,
            0.747,
            0.915,
            0.809
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4）DEPC 处理的水:水中溶解 0.1% 的 DEPC，室温下放置 12h，高压蒸汽灭菌 15min，以除去 DEPC（DEPC 可与胺类发生反应，因此含有 Tris 的溶液不能用 DEPC 处理，应选用新开瓶的 Tris 晶体以避免 RNA 酶污染）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 26,
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.817,
            0.223,
            0.84
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【作业】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 27,
          "bbox": [
            0.168,
            0.848,
            0.549,
            0.868
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "硫氰酸胍一步法提取总RNA并检测得率。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 28,
          "bbox": [
            0.824,
            0.88,
            0.911,
            0.898
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(刘兵)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
